0..72 Comment "// Transport along a composite ending in `ua`: the cubical case table of"
73..149 Comment "// Cohen, Coquand, Huber and Mörtberg, _Cubical Type Theory: a constructive"
150..224 Comment "// interpretation of the univalence axiom_ (TYPES 2015, arXiv:1611.02108),"
225..309 Comment "// § 4.5, read at the universe. `Path.step(p, ua(e))` is the transport of `p` along"
310..387 Comment "// `ua(e)` in `y. Path(Type, a, y)`, and transport along it moves the operand"
388..463 Comment "// along `p`, then applies the record\'s forward map. A first path that does"
464..534 Comment "// not compute, as `p` here, is carried on as the value it stands for."
536..607 Comment "// The circle, the presented integers, the winding number and spinning."
